  "description": "Second batch of lander cases: the four remaining Apollo landings. Same sources and the same rules as the first batch (cases.json, thresholds.json); thresholds.json is not changed. Every published value was read from its source on 14 November 2026 and is given as printed. Committed before the core was run on these cases.",
